  nextButton: {fileID: 662050419322794112}
  lines:
  - text: "Cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng ng\xE0y n\xE0y c\u0169ng \u0111\u1EBFn. "
  - text: "Ta c\xF3 m\u1ED9t nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 quan tr\u1ECDng cho c\u1EADu."
  - text: "Ng\xE2n h\xE0ng trung t\xE2m \u1EDF khu t\xE0i ch\xEDnh\u2026 "
  - text: "Trong \u0111\xF3 c\xF3 m\u1ED9t kho b\u1EA1c ch\u1EE9a v\xE0ng."
  - text: "Ta mu\u1ED1n c\u1EADu chi\u1EBFm to\xE0n b\u1ED9 kho b\u1EA1c tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      khi c\u1EA3nh s\xE1t k\u1ECBp ph\u1EA3n \u1EE9ng"
  - text: "L\u01B0u \xFD: H\xE3y c\u1EA3i trang \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n
      nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5"
  typingSpeed: 0.05
